Inline α² + β₁₀ on ℝⁿ.
Root √(x²+y²) and fraction a/((b)/(c)).
Percent: 3.8% and 100000 × 3.8% × ((360)/(365)) ≈ 3747.95.
Unsupported: $\unknown{x_y}$ and $\frac{a}{b}^2$.
Angles: <x>, <α>, and <$\unknown{x}$>.
Code: $\alpha$; money: $5 and $10; shell: $HOME.
